%% plev frame flow. update with arc.md/arc.yaml on structural change.
sequenceDiagram
    participant E as event (winit/touch/ime)
    participant I as input state
    participant A as app state
    participant S as scene build (per frame)
    participant C as compositor (dirty layers)
    participant T as text system (atlas)
    participant G as gpu passes
    participant P as surface (srgb view)

    E->>I: pointer / synthesized touch
    I->>A: hit regions -> events drained
    A->>A: mutate state
    A->>C: invalidate + request_redraw
    Note over A,C: render on demand: no change, no frame
    A->>S: build scene nodes
    %% animation playback: crates/monster MonsterPlayer consumes the tick at A
    %% and hands S a lowered SceneNode scene (scene_at)
    S->>C: push to layers (hash per layer)
    C->>C: resolve only dirty layers
    C->>T: resolve text runs (one TextStyle measure==draw, atlas raster at hidpi scale)
    T->>G: glyph atlas quads
    C->>G: encode layer passes (quads, sdf, shadow, image, text, backdrop)
    G->>P: composite into srgb view (encode-on-write)
    P->>P: present (identical pixels on every target)
    %% perf (opt-in via RenderConfig): AnimationTick + RenderStats feed
    %% crates/engine/src/perf PerfMonitor after submit; log line every N frames and/or
    %% PerfHud overlay layer drawn by C (hud on = continuous frames)
